<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="row justify-content-center py-4">
  <div class="col-lg-9 col-md-11">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white">
      <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3">Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last Updated: October 2026</p>

      <div class="text-secondary" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          We collect your full name, email address, optional contact number, and descriptions of lost and found belongings submitted through the portal. Passwords are securely hashed with industry-standard bcrypt before storage and are never retrievable in plain-text.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">2. Confidential Private Notes</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          Any identifying serial numbers, private marks, lock codes, or sensitive notes provided in the "Private Identifying Notes" field are restricted to you and authenticated platform administrators. They are strictly protected from public indexing and unverified claimants.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">3. Photographic Evidence</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          Uploaded photographs submitted as ownership proof are stored securely on our servers and accessible only to parties involved in verifying that specific ownership claim.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">4. Data Retention and Account Control</h5>
        <p class="small mb-0">
          Users retain full control to edit or delete their item reports at any time. When an item report is deleted, all associated claims, image files, and notifications are pruned safely.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
